Description: wrap long launcher titles onto a second line
 Long titles shown below icons are wrapped at word boundaries instead of
 being truncated immediately. UTF-8 boundaries are preserved, and only the
 second line is ellipsized when two lines are still not enough.
Author: MiniOS Linux <support@minios.dev>
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-09-01

